#: routes/splash.py:35
msgid "That was... something."
msgstr "Quello è stato... qualcosa."

#: routes/splash.py:38
msgid "Congratulations! That was unbelievable!"
msgstr "Congratulazioni! È stato incredibile!"

#: routes/splash.py:39
msgid "Wow, have you tried auditioning for The Voice?"
